<title>POLAND: APATOR JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>APATOR JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.51 vs   0.55</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.55 vs   0.64</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.40 vs   0.31</p>
<p> Sales		    5.77 vs   5.71</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.81 vs   2.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.00 vs   4.67</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.68 vs   5.55</p>
<p> Sales		   45.15 vs  40.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish gauge maker is Apator SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
